    "summary": "The user expresses profound nihilism and hopelessness following a major life failure, using business metaphors like \"sunk cost\" and \"cutting losses\" to question the point of continuing to live. The assistant responds by attempting to validate the user's feelings of frustration while simultaneously offering reframing and encouragement to find new paths and recognize their resilience.",
